 "interpretation_limit": "E-B1 and E-B2 are library-level descriptive contrasts on deposited TPM with no animal field, so neither supports animal-level or causal inference. Div.1 and Total are overlapping sorted populations of the same cultures with no pairing field declared, so the division phenotype is an association between two gated populations, not a measurement of what a dividing cell does. E-B2 compares two drugs whose solvents differ, so a shared solvent effect cannot be excluded. E-B3 is donor-level and paired, which is the strongest unit in the package, but the signatures transported are the mouse study's own and the cohort was collected for another purpose; a compartment difference is not evidence about disease.",
